                <note rend="inline" type="source">493.11 Changsha/4: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-04T19:00:00-04:00">September 4, 1930—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>309. Your 775, September 2, 7 p.m. Department concurs in the suggestion and
                    opinion set forth in paragraph 2.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
